        <activityName xml:lang="en">Disposal, printer, laser jet, b/w, to WEEE treatment</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Disposal, printer, laser jet, b/w, to WEEE treatment
mix process of the two disposal ways - the manual dismantling and the mechanical treatment (in a shredder); UUID: 2b9b5978-d7ec-448d-8d1b-b96eec7dad0a
This dataset represents the statistical mixture of the two different disposal ways for WEEE devices in Switzerland.
Location: data of the situation in Switzerland. The split of manual and mechanical treatment for waste printers is taken from the recent data of SWICO and SENS technical report (SWICO &amp; SENS, 2022).
Technology: current mix of manual and mechanical treatment in Switzerland
Time period: Unspecified
Production volume: 82.5 kt total WEEE
Sampling: statistical data
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_2b9b5978-d7ec-448d-8d1b-b96eec7dad0a.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
